-- Tests for sgba-p10a-d1-d2.l4 (ss 45B to 45J), sgba-p10a-d3.l4 (ss 45K to 45O) and sgba-p10a-d4.l4 (ss 45P to 45T). Expected values are written from the text of each provision.

