#ASSERT `s 45N(2) the punishment on conviction`'s `daily fine` EQUALS `a further fine not exceeding, per day or part of a day after conviction` 100000
#ASSERT NOT (`s 45N(3) it matters whether the service is provided from outside Singapore or in or from Singapore` TRUE)
-- notice before regulatory action: at least 14 days to make representations
#ASSERT `s 45O(1) the notice is the notice the Authority must give before exercising its powers under section 45N(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE 14
#ASSERT NOT (`s 45O(1) the notice is the notice the Authority must give before exercising its powers under section 45N(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE 13)
